cinema:"Early films were silent and often shown with live musicians.",
heart:"The heart beats about 100,000 times a day.",
lungs:"You breathe roughly 20,000 times a day.",
digest:"Your small intestine is about 6 meters long.",
bones:"Babies have about 300 bones, and adults have 206.",
sleep:"Dolphins sleep with one half of the brain at a time.",
