/* data/terms7.js */
window.TERMS=(window.TERMS||[]).concat(["Abstract art|Art that does not depict recognizable objects.","Allegory|A story with a hidden symbolic meaning.","Alveoli|The tiny air sacs in the lungs where gas is exchanged.","Anatomy|The study of the structure of the body.","Anesthesia|Medication that blocks pain or consciousness.","Anthology|A collection of literary works.","Aorta|The main artery carrying blood from the heart.","Artery|A vessel that carries blood away from the heart.","Calcium|A mineral that is vital for bones and teeth.","Capillary|A tiny blood vessel linking arteries and veins.","Carbohydrate|A sugar or starch that provides energy.","Cholesterol|A fatty substance found in the blood.","Collagen|A protein that gives strength to skin and bones.","Concerto|A musical work for a soloist and orchestra.","Cubism|An early 20th-century art style that shows subjects from many angles.","Diagnosis|Identifying a disease from its signs and symptoms.","Diaphragm|The muscle beneath the lungs that drives breathing.","Digestion|The breakdown of food into nutrients.","Epidemic|A rapid spread of a disease through a population.","Fable|A short story with a moral, often featuring animals.","Fiber|Plant material that aids digestion.","Genre|A category of art or literature.","Haiku|A short Japanese poem of three lines.","Immunity|The body’s resistance to disease.","Insulin|A hormone that controls blood sugar.","Libretto|The text of an opera.","Ligament|A band of tissue connecting bones at a joint.","Lipid|A fat or oil.","Memoir|A written account of one’s own life.","Metaphor|A figure of speech that compares things directly.","Mosaic|A picture made of small pieces of stone or glass.","Mural|A painting made on a wall.","Narrator|The voice that tells a story.","Octave|The interval between one note and the note with double its frequency.","Opera|A drama set to music and sung with an orchestra.","Palette|A board for mixing paint, or the range of colors an artist uses.","Pancreas|An organ that makes digestive enzymes and insulin.","Pandemic|An epidemic that spreads across many countries.","Perspective|A method of showing depth on a flat surface.","Pigment|A substance that gives color.","Portrait|An artwork that depicts a person.","Prose|Ordinary written language, as opposed to poetry.","Protagonist|The main character of a story.","Quarantine|Isolation to prevent a disease from spreading.","Reflex|An automatic, rapid response to a stimulus.","Satire|Writing that mocks faults with humor.","Sculpture|Art carved or modeled in three dimensions.","Simile|A comparison that uses like or as.","Skeleton|The bony framework of the body.","Sonata|A piece of music for one or two instruments.","Sonnet|A poem of fourteen lines.","Stanza|A group of lines in a poem.","Surrealism|An art movement that explores dreams and the unconscious.","Symphony|A large orchestral work in several movements.","Symptom|A sign of illness felt by a patient.","Tempo|The speed of a piece of music.","Tendon|A tough cord connecting muscle to bone.","Vein|A vessel that carries blood back to the heart.","Vitamin|An organic nutrient needed in small amounts."]);

