window.TERMS=(window.TERMS||[]).concat(["Aperture|The opening in a camera lens or telescope that lets in light.","Aquaculture|The farming of fish, shellfish and plants in water.","Asteroid belt|The region between Mars and Jupiter where most asteroids orbit.","Budget|A plan for income and spending.","Capitalism|An economic system in which private owners run businesses for profit.","Communism|A system in which property is held in common and the state directs the economy.","Consumer price index|A measure of the average change in prices paid by households.","Corporation|A company that is legally treated as separate from its owners.","Crop rotation|Planting different crops in turn to keep soil fertile.","Deficit|The amount by which spending exceeds income.","Deflation|A general fall in prices.","Demographics|Statistics about a population, such as age and income.","Ecliptic|The Sun’s apparent yearly path across the sky.","Exchange rate|The price of one currency in terms of another.","Fertilizer|A substance added to soil to help plants grow.","Free trade|Trade between countries without tariffs or quotas.","Harvest|The gathering of a mature crop.","Interest|The cost of borrowing money, or the return on lending it.","Irrigation|Supplying water to crops by artificial means.","Labor union|An organization of workers that bargains with employers.","Livestock|Animals raised for food or work.","Mercantilism|An old economic idea that a nation grows rich by exporting more than it imports.","Monoculture|The farming of a single crop over a large area.","Pesticide|A chemical used to kill pests that harm crops.","Poverty line|The income level below which a person is considered poor.","Productivity|Output produced per worker or per hour of work.","Profit|The money left after costs are subtracted from revenue.","Reflector|A telescope that uses mirrors to gather light.","Refractor|A telescope that uses lenses to gather light.","Revenue|Money that a business or government takes in.","Shutter|The part of a camera that controls how long light reaches the sensor.","Tax|A required payment to a government.","Terraforming|Changing a planet to make it habitable.","Trade surplus|When a country exports more than it imports.","Urbanization|The growth of cities as more people move into them.","Wage|Payment to a worker for labor.","Wealth|The total value of what a person or nation owns.","Yield|The amount of crop produced per unit of land.","Zodiac|The band of sky along the ecliptic through which the Sun, Moon and planets appear to travel."]);
